<div class="reu-policy__section" id="pre-order-status">
  <h2>1. Pre-Order Status</h2>
  <p>Products marked “PRE-ORDER” are not available for immediate shipment.</p>
  <p>Placing a pre-order reserves the selected product from an upcoming production release.</p>
  <p>The PRE-ORDER status must be visible on product cards, product pages, in the cart and before checkout.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="estimated-shipping-window">
  <h2>2. Estimated Shipping Window</h2>
  <p>The current estimated shipping window will be shown on:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>The product page</li>
    <li>Near the Pre-Order button</li>
    <li>In the cart</li>
    <li>Before checkout</li>
    <li>In the order confirmation</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Shipping windows are estimates based on information received from production and fulfilment partners. They are not guaranteed delivery dates.</p>
  <p>Do not publish this policy until the supplier has provided a written, supportable estimated shipping window.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="payment-timing">
  <h2>3. Payment Timing</h2>
  <p>The payment timing will be shown clearly before checkout.</p>
  <p>Depending on the final pre-order configuration, payment may be collected in full at checkout, collected partially as a deposit, or collected when the product is ready for fulfilment.</p>
  <p>The store must display one exact payment rule matching the installed Shopify pre-order application and payment provider before accepting orders.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="production-updates">
  <h2>4. Production Updates</h2>
  <p>We will send production and shipping updates to the email address used during checkout.</p>
  <p>Customers are responsible for ensuring that their email address is accurate and that REÚ messages are not being blocked or sent to spam.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="delays">
  <h2>5. Delays</h2>
  <p>If we learn that an order cannot ship within the stated estimated window, we will provide a revised estimate.</p>
  <p>Customers will be informed of their option to continue waiting or cancel the unshipped order for a prompt refund.</p>
  <p>Where applicable law requires affirmative consent to a delay, REÚ will request that consent.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="address-changes">
  <h2>6. Address Changes</h2>
  <p>Contact REÚ as soon as possible if you need to change the delivery address.</p>
  <p>Address changes cannot be guaranteed after an order enters production, processing or fulfilment.</p>
  <p>Customers are responsible for providing a complete and deliverable address.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="shipping-destinations-and-rates">
  <h2>7. Shipping Destinations and Rates</h2>
  <p>Available shipping destinations, delivery services and rates will be displayed during checkout.</p>
  <p>The final countries, regions, shipping methods, carriers and rates must be confirmed before launch.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="orders-containing-pre-order-and-available-products">
  <h2>8. Orders Containing Pre-Order and Available Products</h2>
  <p>The merchant must confirm whether available and pre-order products:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Ship together when every product is ready, or</li>
    <li>Ship separately as products become available</li>
  </ul>
  <p>The final rule and any additional shipping charges must be displayed in the cart before checkout.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="tracking">
  <h2>9. Tracking</h2>
  <p>When an order ships, tracking information will be sent to the email address provided during checkout.</p>
  <p>Carrier tracking may take additional time to update after a shipping label is created.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="international-duties-and-taxes">
  <h2>10. International Duties and Taxes</h2>
  <p>For international orders, duties, import taxes and customs charges may apply.</p>
  <p>The store must state before launch whether these charges are collected during checkout or remain the customer’s responsibility.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="contact-us">
  <h2>11. Contact Us</h2>
  <p>Questions about shipping, delivery or pre-orders can be submitted through the <a href="{{ pages.contact.url | default: '/pages/contact' }}">Contact page</a>.</p>
</div>
